      <title>Interfaith Leaders Roundtable Conversation</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">61416737</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/3a92521</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none; background-color: #00539b;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/07/9803495/emailbanner-faithleaders-july24_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Interfaith Leaders Roundtable: Image of people praying" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Columbus is in a pivotal moment, and it requires us to come together to build the necessary infrastructure to preserve what makes Columbus beautiful while continuing to steward love across our community.<br><br>Mayor Andrew J. Ginther cordially invites you to join an Interfaith Leaders Roundtable for a vital conversation about our city's projected growth and the role initiatives like Zone In will play in fostering an equitable response. Your presence and leadership are invaluable to this city, and we look forward to your participation in helping our city thrive!</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>When:</strong><br><em>Wednesday, July 24, 2024</em><br>1:30-2PM, Welcome Reception<br>2-3PM, Interfaith Leaders Round Table Conversation<br>3-3:30PM, Zone In Gallery Tour</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Where:<br></strong>Zone In Gallery<br>141 N. Front St. (Conference room located on the first floor of the garage)<br>Free parking is provided in the building’s garage.<br><br><em>Space is limited. Please register using the link below:</em></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><a href="https://forms.gle/TSwSMLY5tn2mCtyz5?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">REGISTER</a><br><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Questions? Please contact Danius Williams at <a href="mailto:DFWilliams@columbus.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">DFWilliams@columbus.gov</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
